  "notes": [
    "Complete list: 2 actions (src/actions.js) and 2 boolean feedbacks (src/feedbacks.js), plain assignments in initActions/initFeedbacks. Variables and presets are not catalogued.",
    "Protocol: MQTT over WebSocket to ws://<host>/mqtt with the configured username and password (src/api.js initMqtt). Each command publishes an empty JSON object {} to <prefix>/<command>/<timestamp>, with the prefixes Session/0/Record (recording) and Session/0/Stream/0 (streaming) (index.js). Unlike teradek-prism there is no Low-Latency prefix.",
    "Quirk kept as written: the feedback option defaults are 'recording' (recordingState) and 'broadcasting' (streamingState), lowercase values that are not among the choice ids (Recording, Ready, ...; Live, Ready, ...). A new feedback therefore starts with a default that matches no choice.",
    "Action streamingControl ids 'Sharelink/publish' and 'Sharelink/unpublish' contain a slash and are appended to the topic as written.",
    "Built on @companion-module/base ^1.12.1: options do not support expressions."
  ]
